cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "harpd-mcp"
message: >-
  If you use this server, please cite it as below. The datasets it serves are
  published by Harpd and licensed CC BY 4.0; cite the dataset too when you
  quote the data.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Harpd"
    name-particle: ""
    given-names: ""
    email: harpdsupport@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/harpd-dev/harpd-mcp"
url: "https://harpd.com/data/"
abstract: >-
  harpd-mcp is a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes Harpd's open
  AI product, ranking, research and evidence datasets to AI agents over stdio.
  It provides 11 tools covering a 1,122-product AI catalog, three Harpd Rank
  boards (overall, monthly, weekly), 28 category boards, the AI Market Index,
  AI agent / AI tools / developer tools Discovery Index slices, published
  monthly research and the Harpd Evidence Graph. Every tool result carries
  mandatory provenance (source, sourceUrl, dataset path, updatedAt, license,
  attribution and evidence links). The server encodes two domain rules: that
  rankPoints are promotional placement bought with Credits rather than an
  editorial quality score, and that the repository contains three live
  period-scoped board snapshots rather than a multi-month historical time
  series.
keywords:
  - mcp
  - model context protocol
  - ai agents
  - artificial intelligence
  - ai products
  - ai tools
  - ai rankings
  - open data
  - dataset
  - provenance
  - typescript
license: MIT
license-url: "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-16"
references:
